   "description": {
    "en_EN": "Featuring a clover motif with an antique finish, this pewter and brass tankard is perfect for making a traditional Stella Fortuna toast to \"Tempt Fate.\"",
    "de_DE": "Mit einem Kleeblattmotiv und antikem Finish ist dieser Zinn- und Messingkrug perfekt, um einen traditionellen Stella Fortuna Toast auf \"Tempt Fate\" auszusprechen.",
    "zh_CN": "\u8fd9\u6b3e\u767d\u9574\u548c\u9ec4\u94dc\u5236\u7684\u5564\u9152\u676f\u91c7\u7528\u4e86\u4e09\u53f6\u8349\u56fe\u6848\u548c\u4eff\u53e4\u9970\u9762\uff0c\u975e\u5e38\u9002\u5408\u5e78\u8fd0\u661f\u8282\u7684\u4f20\u7edf\u795d\u9152\u8bcd\u201c\u6311\u6218\u547d\u8fd0\u201d\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Dot\u00e9e d'un motif tr\u00e8fle et d'une finition antique, cette chope en \u00e9tain et en laiton est parfaite pour porter un toast traditionnel Stella Fortuna \u00e0 \"Tempt Fate\"."
   },
